Package: TradeTesterR
Type: Package
Title: Educational Backtesting Framework for Quantitative Trading Strategies
Version: 0.1.2.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Alberto", "Pallotta", 
           email = "pallottaalberto@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An educational framework for inspecting historical trading
    simulations using 'data.table'. Processes market, limit and stop entry
    instructions, caller-supplied ask/bid bars, fixed and trailing exits, and
    partial position exits. Includes closed-trade performance summaries and
    rolling parameter search. Execution uses simplified bar thresholds, not an
    order book, general slippage, commission or margin model. Strategies must
    specify information availability, position units and execution assumptions.
License: GPL-3
